:"rng: a seeded linear congruential generator.

   The state (state, count) is private to this module. The only way to move
   it is through the exported functions, so every module that imports rng
   draws from the same sequence: the file runs once and everyone gets the
   same instance."

m::2147483648
state::1
count::0

step()::{count::count+1;state::((1103515245*state)+12345)!m;state}
reset(n)::{state::n!m;count::0;state}
uniform(n)::{{step()%m}'!n}
noise(n)::{(uniform(n)-0.5)*3.4641016151377544}
draws()::{count}

.p("[rng] loaded")
:" shows: rename on export (reset is exposed as seed); step, state, count, m stay private"
.export(:{;"seed";reset;"uniform";uniform;"noise";noise;"draws";draws})
